      "id": "claim_1c2284b041f1433d905d3c33d707287a",
      "statement": "HO-3 2011-05 governs policies written on or after 2011-05-01 that were written before the 2018 edition and continues to govern adjustment of losses under those policies regardless of report date; HO-3 2018-09 governs policies written on or after 2018-09-01, so 2018-only conditions cannot be imported into a 2011 policy.",
